          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When a King Quan travel token appears as the hyena path reward, Fang Yuan drops both the white silver relic Gu and the two tasks at once Gu from his attention. He also judges Multitask Gu the most important tool for an enslavement path Gu Master.",
        "chapters": [
